WEBVTT

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:11.970
Decision models turn data into action. The next best action suggests what to do for each account.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:19.170
The What-If simulator shows, live, the impact of changing price, conversion rate or the number of leads.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:24.380
The sales forecast weights the pipeline by the closing probability of each stage.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:30.210
And the R-F-M segmentation reveals who your champion customers are and who is at risk.

